      "text": "BatchWriter (postgresStore.ts)\nwithClient: owns error \u00b7 destroy on fail\nBEGIN \u00b7 set-based via unnest\nbind devices (foreign \u2192 dead letter)\nINSERT readings ORDER BY key\n  ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING\nUPSERT device_state WHERE newer\nstatuses by gateway \u00b7 COMMIT",
      "originalText": "BatchWriter (postgresStore.ts)\nwithClient: owns error \u00b7 destroy on fail\nBEGIN \u00b7 set-based via unnest\nbind devices (foreign \u2192 dead letter)\nINSERT readings ORDER BY key\n  ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING\nUPSERT device_state WHERE newer\nstatuses by gateway \u00b7 COMMIT",
