    {
      "id": "text-92",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1622,
      "y": 794.375,
      "width": 684.75,
      "height": 131.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1286970024,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1306720430,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Crash windows\n\u00b7 ingest dies before step 6 \u2192 no PUBACK \u2192 broker redelivers (DUP=1) \u2192 stored once\n\u00b7 ingest dies between 6 and 7 \u2192 redelivered \u2192 ON CONFLICT ignores it \u2192 stored once\n\u00b7 broker crashes with a backlog \u2192 up to one persist-sqlite flush (5 s) of queue lost;\n   the gateways already deleted those messages (the honest limit of Stage 2)\n\u00b7 WAN down \u2192 gateway buffers in SQLite (50k, drop-oldest, counted) and replays\n   in order at \u2264 200 msg/s; dropped ones show up as explained gaps",
      "originalText": "Crash windows\n\u00b7 ingest dies before step 6 \u2192 no PUBACK \u2192 broker redelivers (DUP=1) \u2192 stored once\n\u00b7 ingest dies between 6 and 7 \u2192 redelivered \u2192 ON CONFLICT ignores it \u2192 stored once\n\u00b7 broker crashes with a backlog \u2192 up to one persist-sqlite flush (5 s) of queue lost;\n   the gateways already deleted those messages (the honest limit of Stage 2)\n\u00b7 WAN down \u2192 gateway buffers in SQLite (50k, drop-oldest, counted) and replays\n   in order at \u2264 200 msg/s; dropped ones show up as explained gaps",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-91",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
